          "id": "1825990269596049665",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "I’m confident we will see large-scale quantum supercomputers in our lifetimes\n\nThe Google Quantum roadmap is to get to 1M physical qubits, and once we accomplish that we will keep going.\n\nWe will get to billions of physical qubits in our lifetimes.",
