          "id": "1825990265946906810",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "There’s a number of threads of very interesting research:\n\n- quantum chip design\n- whole quantum computer design\n- quantum chip manufacturing\n- quantum error correction\n- quantum algorithms\n- applications to science and other fields\n\nand all are ripe for LOTS of progress",
