          "id": "1819086560622792827",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "7/ We see strengths (Claude 3.5 w/coding, Gemini 1.5 w/Vision, Multilingual) from the models that are likely driven by post-training and data strategies.\n\nThis is contrary to the prevailing beliefs 1 yr ago, where pre-training was believed to be the core competitive driver.",
