          "id": "1819086551420436813",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "6/ Post-training data strategy is becoming a key arena for competition.\n\nLlama3.1 paper had 15 pg about post-training data (vs. 12 pg on pre-training), driving these capabilities:\n\n- Code\n- Multilinguality\n- Math/Reasoning\n- Long-Context\n- Tool Use\n- Factuality\n- Steerability",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1819086560622792827"
    },
