            "id": "1825990261220036848",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Quantum computing as a field is at a very exciting stage\n\nNow that we’ve demonstrated quantum supremacy, we know quantum computers work and are real.\n\nNow it’s mostly a question of how we scale and optimize these systems"
